(poset predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRelCompatibleElements}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRelCompatibleElements}_S\\)</span> (compatibility predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"rRp\">\\(rRp\\)</span> abbreviates <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle r,p\\rangle\\in R\">\\(\\langle r,p\\rangle\\in R\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"rRq\">\\(rRq\\)</span> abbreviates <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle r,q\\rangle\\in R\">\\(\\langle r,q\\rangle\\in R\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRelIncompatibleElements}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRelIncompatibleElements}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}incompatible\\text{-}elements} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRelIncompatibleElements}_S(p,q,P,R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\\land p,q\\in P\\land\\neg\\mathrm{ZfcRelCompatibleElements}_S(p,q,P,R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}incompatible\\text{-}elements} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRelIncompatibleElements}_S(p,q,P,R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\\land p,q\\in P\\land\\neg\\mathrm{ZfcRelCompatibleElements}_S(p,q,P,R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Incompatibility is the negation of the registered compatibility predicate on the same typed poset.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false}